^BBase32 notes^b

    ^BAlphabet possiblilites^b
        Use only lowercase (no shift needed, fewer visual conflicts). ¿Do
        not use vowels so as not to make words? Symbols are chosen for 
        visual reasons, up and down strokes only, visually distinct from
        other characters in the alphabet. Two of them require a shift on
        a keyboard, but tradeoffs.

        ^Wa^wbcd^We^wfgh^Wi^wjk^El^emn^Wo^wpqrst^Wu^wvwxyz  ^V20 characters^v
        ^E01^e23456789                  ^V 8 characters^v
        =-:+                        ^V 4 characters^v

